# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ts-health
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Captured output.
# A real run prints your public IP, tailnet and LAN addresses, and device
# hostnames. Sanitize before putting any of it in README.md — never commit
# a raw capture.
*.log
*.out
output/
sample-output*
ts-health-*.txt

# Local scratch / experiments
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej
*.tmp
*.local
scratch/

# Editor & OS cruft
*~
*.sw[a-p]
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/

# Lint artifacts
shellcheck.out
*.shellcheck

# Python bytecode — the script shells out to python3, and any helper
# scripts added later would drop these here.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# Environment / secrets. Nothing here needs them today; cheap insurance.
.env
.env.*
